  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Competition is a high-performance co-polyester monofilament engineered for exceptional control, maximum durability and long-lasting playability. It is especially well suited to aggressive baseline players, frequent string breakers and players using racquets with open string patterns. The 1.20 mm version offers more feel and response, the 1.25 mm version provides the best overall balance, and the 1.30 mm version maximizes durability and stability for demanding hitters.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Competition 是一款高性能共聚酯单丝球线，核心优势是极高控制力、出色耐久性以及长期稳定的可打表现。它特别适合积极进攻型底线球员、经常断线的球员，以及使用开放式线床球拍的玩家。1.20毫米版本更强调手感和响应；1.25毫米综合表现最均衡；1.30毫米版本则将耐久性和稳定性发挥到最高，更适合大力量击球和高频比赛使用。"
  },

